Package: canopytrials
Title: Shared Field Trial Helpers for CanopyLab Agronomics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("CanopyLab", "Agronomics", email = "agronomy@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The data access and summary functions that CanopyLab's field trial
    reports, dashboards and services all share. Wrapping them in a package rather
    than copying them between projects means one definition of "yield response",
    tested once and versioned. This package contains synthetic data and analysis
    created for demonstration purposes only.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    DBI,
    dplyr,
    duckdb,
    ggplot2,
    readr,
    rlang,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
